    "created_at": "2018-12-12T14:29:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-12-12T14:29:57Z",
    "body": "I'd rather only modify `script` elements, as we already know they have an internal slot around this, whereas adding a new internal slot to all elements is more invasive (e.g., it requires changing DOM).\r\n\r\nWhat's the reason to expose it on all elements if you can only observe it for `script` elements?",
