    "updated_at": "2018-12-12T15:37:11Z",
    "body": "Yeah, I think I'd prefer not generalizing until the need is concrete. Also, I didn't realize it was still somewhat dynamic, in that it depends on a CSP check, in which case I agree that it needs to be a new flag of sorts.",
